Z||000000||cscougar||11-01-2000||10:22 AM||||I have a problem and need some help.  My 2.8 V-6 starts fine, runs smooth but after warming up (and it doesn't get hot by any means) it has a slight miss.  I have changed the coil, and the IAC.  Does anyone have any ideas.  The miss doesn't affect acceleration or highway speeds but shows up at idle, both with the car in park and with the brake on while in drive.<P>No codes are displayed.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||maninblack||11-01-2000||11:12 AM||||this is the hardest part of problem solving.<BR>a miss could occur from a jump from the timming chain,a bad spark plugs and or almost everythings else.But I would suggest <BR>to check the usual first,plugs wire timming.<BR>good luck||||reg||1
Z||000002||BAM-BAM||11-01-2000||11:31 AM||||  Could also be the ignition module. They have a tendency (when they start to go) to create a misfire after they warm up. Aslo just could use some heat sink compound on the module.<BR> Just a thought, this has been posted many time before.<P> Peace, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT<BR>Eibach Springs/KYB shocks and struts<BR>Mr.Mikes 500 series seats, Carpet and headliner! MOMO Commando Steering Wheel, White Face Race Style Guages And Soon To Be More!!! YEAH BABY-YEAH||||reg||12
Z||000003||Oreif||11-01-2000||11:38 AM||||You could also get some "Gumout Tune-up Spray" and spray the throttle body/intake.<BR>It is safe to use on fuel injected engines and cleans out the carbon in the intake system. It could be that the IAC port is dirty or any of the vacuum ports. Generally I spray the throttle platen (throttle plate wide open) without the engine running and let it sit about 5 minutes. Then I start the car and spray it into the intake while reving the engine. (you'll need to keep the RPM's higher to keep it running while you are spraying) I usually do this when I tune-up the vehicle. Are you sure it's a "miss" and not a "stumble"?<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 11-01-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||StuGood||11-01-2000||12:45 PM||||Surest cure for a MISS?  Get her married off  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> .  Sorry about that...had to beat Phil to it...||||reg||12
